  "name": "Venomancer mounting drops Vizier Form and Wasp Form (#12826)",
  "contract": [
    "#12826: mounting in Vizier Form 800912 kept the form up. Spider, Beetle and Weaver forms carry the native",
    "mount interrupt flag and #6281 asserts the mount drops them; the maintainer ruled that every Venomancer form",
    "drops on mount. Vizier Form and Wasp Form 805141 lacked the flag. Venomwing Form 520307 already drops on any",
    "cast. Each form is learned and cast, the Brown Horse 458 is cast while in it, and once mounted the form must",
    "be gone. Native dismount separates the two cases. Vizier Form is taught by its specialization passive",
    "504798, which the fixture learns first. Wasp Form is a flying form (SPELL_ATTR4_ONLY_FLYING_AREAS) and fails",
    "with SPELL_FAILED_INCORRECT_AREA where flying is not allowed, so the fixture stands in Hellfire Peninsula",
    "with 300 riding skill."
  ],
